<title>ARGENTINA: IRSA year net rises slightly to $21.03 mln.</title>
<headline>IRSA year net rises slightly to $21.03 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to June 30. Net $21.03 million vs $20.61 million. NOTE: By June 30 net worth stood at $264.39 million. The company did not provide figures for revenues, earnings per share or data from the fourth quarter.</p>
<p>Full company name is IRSA Inversiones y Representaciones.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0650</p>
</text>
